BT /F2 17 Tf 54 730.0 Td (Hewlett Packard Enterprise - Information Security Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703.0 Td (Document ID: HPE-ISP-001 | Version: 4.2 | Classification: Internal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 689.0 Td (Owner: Office of the Chief Information Security Officer \(CISO\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675.0 Td (Effective Date: 15 January 2026 | Next Review: 15 January 2027) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655.0 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 629.0 Td (1. Purpose and Objective) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 606.0 Td (The purpose of this Information Security Policy is to establish Hewlett Packard Enterprise's \(HPE\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 592.0 Td (overarching commitment to protecting the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 578.0 Td (assets that support our global operations and our customers. Our mission is to safeguard the data,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 564.0 Td (systems, and intellectual property underpinning our GreenLake hybrid cloud platform, Aruba) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550.0 Td (networking, ProLiant/Compute portfolio, HPC/Cray systems, and our SAP S/4HANA ERP environment. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 536.0 Td (objective aligns security outcomes with HPE's business strategy, regulatory obligations, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 522.0 Td (obligations to shareholders of HPE \(NYSE: HPE\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 496.0 Td (2. Scope and Applicability) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473.0 Td (This policy is organization-wide and applies to all employees, contractors, consultants, interns,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459.0 Td (and third parties who access HPE information, systems, or facilities. It covers all information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 445.0 Td (assets-whether stored, processed, or transmitted-across every business unit, geography, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 431.0 Td (technology environment, including on-premises data centers, customer-hosted GreenLake instances, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 417.0 Td (cloud services. No individual or organizational unit is exempt from its applicability.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 391.0 Td (3. Governance and Program Framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368.0 Td (HPE maintains a formal information security program aligned to the NIST Cybersecurity Framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 354.0 Td (\(CSF\) and certified against ISO/IEC 27001. Security governance is exercised through a tiered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 340.0 Td (oversight structure. The Board of Directors, through its Audit Committee, provides ultimate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326.0 Td (oversight of cyber risk. An executive Security Steering Committee, chaired by the CISO and including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312.0 Td (representatives from Legal, HR, Engineering, and Finance, sets strategic direction, reviews risk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298.0 Td (posture, and approves major initiatives. This governance model ensures accountability flows from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 284.0 Td (board through executive management to operational teams.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 258.0 Td (4. Roles and Responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 235.0 Td (- Chief Information Security Officer \(CISO\): Owns this policy, leads the security program, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 221.0 Td (  reports security posture to executive management and the Board.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 207.0 Td (- Executive Management: Champions security culture, endorses funding, and integrates risk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 193.0 Td (  decisions into business planning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 179.0 Td (- Business and Functional Leaders: Implement controls within their domains and manage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 165.0 Td (  remediation of identified gaps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151.0 Td (- All Employees: Comply with this policy, complete required training, and report suspected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 137.0 Td (  incidents promptly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 117.0 Td (Accountability for information security is shared across all stakeholders, with clearly defined) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 103.0 Td (ownership for each control domain.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 77.0 Td (5. Policy Hierarchy and Document Control) Tj ET
endstream
