BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (This document sits at the top of HPE's security documentation hierarchy. It is supported by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 724.0 Td (subordinate standards \(mandatory technical requirements\), procedures \(step-by-step operational) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 710.0 Td (instructions\), and guidelines \(recommended practices\). Version control, revision history, and change) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696.0 Td (logs are maintained for all documents under a formal document control process; each revision is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682.0 Td (tracked, dated, and attributed within the change log below.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 656.0 Td (6. Awareness, Communication, and Training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633.0 Td (This policy is disseminated and published to the workforce via the HPE corporate intranet and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619.0 Td (remains accessible and available to all personnel at all times. Security awareness and education are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 605.0 Td (mandatory: all new hires complete security training during onboarding, and all employees complete) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 591.0 Td (annual refresher training. Ongoing communication campaigns, phishing simulations, and role-based) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 577.0 Td (education reinforce a strong security culture and ensure consistent distribution of policy updates.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 551.0 Td (7. Resources and Funding) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528.0 Td (Executive management commits appropriate resources, budget, and staffing to sustain the security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514.0 Td (program. The CISO organization is funded with dedicated FTEs across security engineering,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 500.0 Td (governance, risk, threat intelligence, and incident response functions, with annual budget planning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486.0 Td (aligned to evolving threats and business growth.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 460.0 Td (8. Metrics and Reporting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437.0 Td (The effectiveness of the security program is measured through defined key performance indicators) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 423.0 Td (\(KPIs\) and key risk indicators. Metrics-including control coverage, patch compliance, training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409.0 Td (completion rates, and incident response times-are reported periodically to the Security Steering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 395.0 Td (Committee, executive management, and the Board to inform decision-making.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 369.0 Td (9. Continuous Improvement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 346.0 Td (HPE is committed to continuous improvement. Findings from audits, incidents, assessments, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 332.0 Td (lessons learned are analyzed to identify gaps and drive remediation. The program is periodically) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 318.0 Td (benchmarked against NIST CSF and ISO 27001 to mature capabilities over time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 292.0 Td (10. Exceptions and Risk Acceptance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269.0 Td (Any deviation from this policy requires a formal exception \(waiver\) request submitted to the CISO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 255.0 Td (organization. Each request is evaluated for risk, and any residual risk must be documented and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 241.0 Td (formally accepted through risk acceptance by an authorized executive risk owner. Exceptions are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 227.0 Td (time-bound and subject to periodic re-review.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 201.0 Td (11. Enforcement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 178.0 Td (Compliance with this policy is mandatory. Violations may result in disciplinary action, up to and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 164.0 Td (including termination of employment or contract, and may carry additional legal or financial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 150.0 Td (sanctions. Consequences are administered consistently in coordination with Human Resources and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 136.0 Td (Legal, commensurate with the severity of the violation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 110.0 Td (12. Review and Approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 87.0 Td (This policy undergoes annual review and is updated as needed to reflect changes in the threat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 73.0 Td (landscape, regulations, and business operations, following a defined review and update cycle. This) Tj ET
